<!-- KLIC native HTML example. Styles/interactions: component bundle. Pattern reference: https://github.com/shadcn-ui/ui/blob/481d523374745e77d0cf9c53a4115ab5dd7c8481/apps/v4/examples/base/alert-dialog-media.tsx -->
<div data-kv-root data-klic-material="surface" data-kv-component="alert-dialog" data-kv-variant="publish" data-klic-component="alert-dialog" class="kn-alert-dialog"><header data-part="heading"><strong>릴리스 노트 v2.4</strong><p data-part="muted">게시 준비 완료</p></header><button type="button" data-klic-surface="control" data-kv-action="open" data-kv-target="kv-export-alert-dialog-alert-dialog-publish-dialog" data-part="btn">팀에 게시</button><dialog role="alertdialog" id="kv-export-alert-dialog-alert-dialog-publish-dialog" aria-label="팀에 게시할까요?" data-klic-surface="overlay" data-part="dialog"><header data-part="heading"><strong>팀에 게시할까요?</strong></header><p data-part="muted">워크스페이스의 모든 멤버가 이 문서를 볼 수 있습니다. 개인 정보가 없는지 확인하세요.</p><div class="ku-actions" data-part="actions"><button type="button" data-klic-surface="control" data-kv-action="dialog-confirm"  data-part="btn">게시 확인</button></div><footer class="ku-actions" data-part="actions"><button type="button" data-klic-surface="control" data-kv-action="close"  data-part="btn">닫기</button></footer></dialog></div>
